@page "/"

<PageTitle>RailDomainCore</PageTitle>

<h1>RailDomainCore</h1>

<p class="lead">ABP + .NET 10 + Blazor Server 的铁路领域核心示例。</p>

<div class="row g-4 mt-1">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5">Version</h2>
                <p class="mb-0">单实体聚合，统一管理 Train、Formation、Route 的版本归属。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5">Train</h2>
                <p class="mb-0">聚合根内部包含 TrainStation 子实体，描述经停站顺序与时刻偏移。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5">Formation</h2>
                <p class="mb-0">与 Train 一对多绑定，表达列车编组方案。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5">Route</h2>
                <p class="mb-0">分别关联 Train 与 Formation，表示运行路径与起终点。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-secondary mt-4 mb-0" role="alert">
    Station 作为独立仓储共享实体，可被多个聚合复用；当前配置为单租户、PostgreSQL、Docker 友好部署。
</div>
